Name: ART libdexfile and libartbase
URL: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/art
Version: N/A
Revision: ddd4776acaa0a4fb0e6027cd063ec450f518c7d7
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: //third_party/libunwindstack/LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Two libraries of the Android Runtime: libdexfile parses dex files, and
libartbase holds the helpers it needs. libunwindstack uses libdexfile to
symbolize interpreted Java frames, and //third_party/libunwindstack
builds both into its libunwindstack target.

src/ holds the files BUILD.gn lists from the libdexfile/ and libartbase/
directories of the upstream repository, plus two headers they include
that BUILD.gn does not list: libartbase/base/unix_file/random_access_file.h
and libdexfile/dex/proto_reference.h. The patches in patches/ change
some of these files.

Local Modifications:
- 0001-disable-fdsan.patch: use fdsan in fd_file.cc only from Android
  API 29.
- 0008-replace-allocator-destroy-construct-calls.patch: use
  std::allocator_traits in hash_set.h.
- 0009-do-not-redefine-ADDRESS_SANITIZER.patch: do not define
  ADDRESS_SANITIZER in memory_tool.h.
- 0010-remove-art-format.patch: no ART_FORMAT, so no fmtlib.
- 0011-remove-dexfile-trace-and-zip-support.patch: no tracing or zip
  support in dex_file_loader.cc.
- 0012-remove-mmap-file-logging.patch: no PrintFileToLog() in
  mem_map.cc.
- 0014-dont-use-bionic-functions.patch: no ART_BASE_ADDRESS code in
  mem_map.cc in NDK builds.
- 0016-remove-static-initializers.patch: no static initializers in
  dex_file_loader and mem_map.
- 0021-add-missing-includes.patch: add <algorithm> and <alloca.h>
  includes.

To update, copy those files at the new revision into src/, then run
from this directory:

$ for patch in patches/*.patch; do patch -s -p1 < $patch; done

and update Revision.
